---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="运营后台" description="见行修学内容架构与上传">
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="group-label" style="margin-top: 0;">内部工具</p>
      <h1>运营后台</h1>
      <p>
        学修为主要内容：左侧选模块，模块内为章节 → 课；进入课后再编辑文字、上传音视频。
        参考书籍与公众号好文在上方分区进入，属于材料区，不计入学修课表。
        视频请先用
        <a href="/api/download?path=media/jianxing-video-helper.zip">见行视频助手</a>
        （Windows，解压整个文件夹）在电脑上检查处理后再上传，以免开播慢或苹果/微信播不了。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div id="ops-login" class="ops-panel">
        <p class="ops-label">登录</p>
        <form id="login-form" class="ops-form-simple">
          <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="运营密码" autocomplete="current-password" required />
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--solid" style="color:#f4f7f5;">登录</button>
        </form>
        <p id="login-msg" class="ops-msg" hidden></p>
      </div>

      <div id="ops-app" hidden>
        <div class="ops-workspace-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="运营分区">
          <button type="button" class="ops-ws-tab is-active" data-ws="module">学修</button>
          <button type="button" class="ops-ws-tab" data-ws="refs">参考书籍</button>
          <button type="button" class="ops-ws-tab" data-ws="articles">公众号好文</button>
        </div>

        <div class="ops-sticky-bar">
          <div id="dirty-banner" class="ops-dirty" hidden>
            有未保存的修改，请点「保存到服务器」。上传成功会自动保存。多人同时编辑时若冲突会提示重新加载；保存前自动备份上一版。
          </div>
          <div class="ops-toolbar">
            <div class="ops-toolbar__ctx">
              <span class="ops-toolbar__label" id="ops-ctx-label">学修</span>
              <strong id="ops-ctx-title">请选择模块</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="ops-toolbar__actions">
              <button type="button" id="btn-save" class="btn btn--solid" style="color:#f4f7f5;">保存到服务器</button>
              <button type="button" id="btn-reload" class="btn" style="color:inherit;border-color:var(--line);">重新加载</button>
              <button type="button" id="logout-btn" class="btn" style="color:inherit;border-color:var(--line);">退出</button>
            </div>
            <span id="save-msg" class="ops-msg" style="margin:0;"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="passages-panel" class="ops-cards-panel ops-cards-panel--collapsible">
          <button type="button" class="ops-cards-toggle" id="btn-passages-toggle" aria-expanded="false">
            <strong>问答索引（向量）</strong>
            <span id="passages-summary" class="ops-cards-summary">加载中…</span>
            <span class="ops-cards-toggle__hint">展开</span>
          </button>
          <div class="ops-cards-body" id="passages-body" hidden>
            <p class="ops-cards-hint">
              见行解惑已改用段落向量混合检索。保存课文后会自动增量重建；也可点下方按钮手动预热。
            </p>
            <div class="ops-cards-actions">
              <button type="button" id="btn-passages-warm" class="btn ops-mini" style="color:inherit;border-color:var(--line);">重建/预热一批</button>
              <button type="button" id="btn-passages-refresh" class="btn ops-mini" style="color:inherit;border-color:var(--line);">刷新状态</button>
            </div>
            <p id="passages-msg" class="ops-msg" hidden style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;"></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ops-grid" id="ops-grid">
          <aside class="ops-side" id="ops-side">
            <div class="ops-side-head">
              <p class="ops-label" style="margin:0;">学修模块</p>
              <button type="button" id="btn-add-module" class="btn ops-mini" style="color:inherit;border-color:var(--line);">+ 添加</button>
            </div>
            <div class="ops-side-filters">
              <input type="search" id="mod-search" class="ops-side-search" placeholder="搜索模块…" autocomplete="off" />
              <select id="mod-status-filter" class="ops-side-select" aria-label="按状态筛选">
                <option value="all">全部状态</option>
                <option value="open">仅开放中</option>
                <option value="coming">仅即将开放</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div id="module-list" class="ops-nav"></div>
          </aside>

          <div class="ops-main" id="module-editor">
            <p class="ops-empty">请选择左侧模块</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="feedback-panel" class="ops-cards-panel ops-cards-panel--collapsible">
          <button type="button" class="ops-cards-toggle" id="btn-feedback-toggle" aria-expanded="false">
            <strong>问题反馈</strong>
            <span id="feedback-summary" class="ops-cards-summary">登录后加载…</span>
            <span class="ops-cards-toggle__hint">展开</span>
          </button>
          <div class="ops-cards-body" id="feedback-body" hidden>
            <div class="ops-cards-actions" style="flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;">
              <select id="fb-filter-type" class="ops-side-select" aria-label="按类型筛选">
                <option value="">全部类型</option>
                <option value="practice">修行问题</option>
                <option value="system">系统问题</option>
              </select>
              <select id="fb-filter-status" class="ops-side-select" aria-label="按状态筛选">
                <option value="">全部状态</option>
                <option value="new">新</option>
                <option value="read">已读</option>
                <option value="archived">已归档</option>
              </select>
              <button type="button" id="btn-feedback-refresh" class="btn ops-mini" style="color:inherit;border-color:var(--line);">刷新</button>
            </div>
            <div id="feedback-list" class="fb-ops-list" style="margin-top:0.75rem;"></div>
            <p id="feedback-msg" class="ops-msg" hidden style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;"></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/ops-app.css?v=20260816b" />
<script type="module" src="/ops-video-compress.js?v=20260725i"></script>
<script src="/ops-app.js?v=20260816d" defer></script>
<script is:inline>
  // 问题反馈面板（独立于 ops-app.js，仅依赖登录 cookie）
  (() => {
    const TYPE_LABEL = { practice: '修行问题', system: '系统问题' };
    const STATUS_LABEL = { new: '新', read: '已读', archived: '已归档' };

    const panel = document.getElementById('feedback-panel');
    const toggle = document.getElementById('btn-feedback-toggle');
    const body = document.getElementById('feedback-body');
    const hint = toggle.querySelector('.ops-cards-toggle__hint');
    const summary = document.getElementById('feedback-summary');
    const listEl = document.getElementById('feedback-list');
    const msgEl = document.getElementById('feedback-msg');
    const typeSel = document.getElementById('fb-filter-type');
    const statusSel = document.getElementById('fb-filter-status');
    const refreshBtn = document.getElementById('btn-feedback-refresh');

    let loaded = false;
    let loading = false;

    function escapeHtml(s) {
      return String(s || '')
        .replace(/&/g, '&amp;')
        .replace(/</g, '&lt;')
        .replace(/>/g, '&gt;')
        .replace(/"/g, '&quot;')
        .replace(/'/g, '&#39;');
    }

    function formatTime(iso) {
      try {
        const d = new Date(iso);
        if (isNaN(d.getTime())) return iso;
        const pad = (n) => String(n).padStart(2, '0');
        return `${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth() + 1)}-${pad(d.getDate())} ${pad(d.getHours())}:${pad(d.getMinutes())}`;
      } catch {
        return iso;
      }
    }

    function setMsg(text, isErr) {
      msgEl.textContent = text || '';
      msgEl.className = 'ops-msg' + (isErr ? ' ops-msg--error' : '');
      msgEl.hidden = !text;
    }

    async function load() {
      if (loading) return;
      loading = true;
      listEl.innerHTML = '<p class="ops-empty" style="margin:0;">加载中…</p>';
      setMsg('');
      try {
        const params = new URLSearchParams();
        if (typeSel.value) params.set('type', typeSel.value);
        if (statusSel.value) params.set('status', statusSel.value);
        const qs = params.toString();
        const res = await fetch('/api/feedback' + (qs ? `?${qs}` : ''), { cache: 'no-store' });
        const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error(data.error || `加载失败（${res.status}）`);
        const items = data.items || [];
        summary.textContent = `共 ${items.length} 条`;
        if (!items.length) {
          listEl.innerHTML = '<p class="ops-empty" style="margin:0;">暂无反馈</p>';
        } else {
          listEl.innerHTML = items.map((it) => {
            const statusOps = ['read', 'archived']
              .filter((s) => s !== it.status)
              .map((s) => `<button type="button" class="btn ops-mini fb-status-btn" data-id="${escapeHtml(it.id)}" data-status="${s}" style="color:inherit;border-color:var(--line);margin-left:0.4rem;">标为${STATUS_LABEL[s]}</button>`)
              .join('');
            return `<article class="fb-item fb-item--${escapeHtml(it.status)}">
              <header class="fb-item__head">
                <span class="fb-item__type fb-item__type--${escapeHtml(it.type)}">${escapeHtml(TYPE_LABEL[it.type] || it.type)}</span>
                <span class="fb-item__status fb-item__status--${escapeHtml(it.status)}">${STATUS_LABEL[it.status] || it.status}</span>
                <span class="fb-item__time">${escapeHtml(formatTime(it.created_at))}</span>
              </header>
              <p class="fb-item__content">${escapeHtml(it.content).replace(/\n/g, '<br>')}</p>
              <footer class="fb-item__foot">
                <span class="fb-item__email">邮箱：<a href="mailto:${escapeHtml(it.email)}">${escapeHtml(it.email)}</a></span>
                <span class="fb-item__ops">
                  ${it.status !== 'new' ? `<button type="button" class="btn ops-mini fb-status-btn" data-id="${escapeHtml(it.id)}" data-status="new" style="color:inherit;border-color:var(--line);margin-left:0.4rem;">标为新</button>` : ''}
                  ${statusOps}
                </span>
              </footer>
            </article>`;
          }).join('');
        }
        loaded = true;
      } catch (err) {
        listEl.innerHTML = '';
        summary.textContent = '加载失败';
        setMsg(err.message || String(err), true);
      } finally {
        loading = false;
      }
    }

    toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const open = body.hasAttribute('hidden');
      if (open) {
        body.hidden = false;
        toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
        hint.textContent = '收起';
        if (!loaded) load();
      } else {
        body.hidden = true;
        toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        hint.textContent = '展开';
      }
    });

    refreshBtn.addEventListener('click', load);
    typeSel.addEventListener('change', () => { loaded = false; load(); });
    statusSel.addEventListener('change', () => { loaded = false; load(); });

    listEl.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {
      const btn = e.target.closest('.fb-status-btn');
      if (!btn) return;
      const id = btn.dataset.id;
      const status = btn.dataset.status;
      btn.disabled = true;
      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/feedback', {
          method: 'PATCH',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ id, status }),
        });
        const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!res.ok || !data.ok) throw new Error(data.error || `更新失败（${res.status}）`);
        await load();
      } catch (err) {
        setMsg(err.message || String(err), true);
      } finally {
        btn.disabled = false;
      }
    });
  })();
</script>
<style>
  .fb-ops-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .fb-item {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }
  .fb-item--new { border-left: 3px solid var(--jade); }
  .fb-item--archived { opacity: 0.65; }
  .fb-item__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .fb-item__type {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .fb-item__type--practice { background: rgba(47, 93, 78, 0.14); color: var(--jade-deep); }
  .fb-item__type--system { background: rgba(31, 99, 145, 0.14); color: #1f6391; }
  .fb-item__status {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    padding: 0.05rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(26, 33, 30, 0.08);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .fb-item__status--new { background: rgba(180, 35, 24, 0.12); color: #b42318; }
  .fb-item__status--read { background: rgba(47, 93, 78, 0.12); color: var(--jade-deep); }
  .fb-item__time { color: var(--ink-soft); margin-left: auto; }
  .fb-item__content {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
  .fb-item__foot {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .fb-item__ops { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
  .ops-msg--error { color: #b42318; }
</style>
